Error [E1306]: Two `#[CLI]` fields both derive the flag `--allow`
  --> tests/ui/cli_authority_flags_reserved.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     allow: String
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: Every field needs a distinct `--flag`; generated commands reserve `--help`, `--allow`, and `--deny`.
 Fix: Rename the colliding field or choose a non-reserved flag name.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1306
